{"data": [{"id": "2122124185615118660", "author_id": "2013894763225980930", "text": "@UPing123zzz 顺序反了这事我深有体会。我第一年也是先玩多智能体，最后发现真正撑住项目的是三件事：错误怎么退、上下文怎么压缩、工具返回怎么校验。这三样没搞定，加多少 agent 都只是把失败放大。你现在带新人，是从哪一步开始教的？", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:26:47.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/baboonAI4S/status/2122124185615118660", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122100894896693643", "author_id": "1666301154165399553", "text": "@UPing123zzz 有个很实在的检验顺序：先问这需求有没有明确标签、量大不大。有标签又要稳，传统模型又快又便宜；没标签、要处理自然语言，才轮到 LLM。顺序反了，成本表一出来就想重写。", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:54:14.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/tiqinge/status/2122100894896693643", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122054193200635966", "author_id": "1390955686142517249", "text": "@UPing123zzz 能用简单模型解决的问题，不一定需要叠加大模型。先明确业务目标和评估指标，再选复杂度合适的工具。", "created_at": "2026-11-15T19:48:40.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/KevinWeb3Nomad/status/2122054193200635966", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121981902261493826", "author_id": "1878345967780646912", "text": "@abc123953468547 @swordBluesy 感谢支持", "created_at": "2026-11-15T15:01:24.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/UPing123zzz/status/2121981902261493826", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121948109001404554", "author_id": "2108438560416415744", "text": "@UPing123zzz 能用逻辑回归解决的事上 Agent，响应慢账单高，还不一定更准hh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T12:47:07.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/TedCai233/status/2121948109001404554", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121944237139005894", "author_id": "1869077220540784640", "text": "@swordBluesy @UPing123zzz 这话在理", "created_at": "2026-11-15T12:31:44.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/abc123953468547/status/2121944237139005894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121943970838405425", "author_id": "1869077220540784640", "text": "@UPing123zzz 我来占个座", "created_at": "2026-11-15T12:30:41.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/abc123953468547/status/2121943970838405425", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121942716812755005", "author_id": "1773034957377798151", "text": "@swordBluesy @UPing123zzz 简单模型能解决的事非上大模型纯属绕远路\n白折腾", "created_at": "2026-11-15T12:25:42.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/YY20070110/status/2121942716812755005", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121937704657068101", "author_id": "2071871914533068800", "text": "@UPing123zzz 这句我站你这边：会调 Agent 不等于懂 AI，几小时搭出应用也不等于懂什么时候该用什么模型。明明一个简单机器学习模型就能解决的业务，非要套大模型再套一层", "created_at": "2026-11-15T12:05:47.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/swordBluesy/status/2121937704657068101", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121933418493772160", "author_id": "2112559128862494720", "text": "@UPing123zzz 同感。能用规则或一个小分类模型稳定跑通的事，硬接大模型反而多了成本、延迟，输出还不稳定。好奇你一般用什么标准判断一个场景该上 LLM，还是传统模型就够？", "created_at": "2026-11-15T11:48:45.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Yunian_Cheng/status/2121933418493772160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121933373841281124", "author_id": "1825556649723240448", "text": "@UPing123zzz Logistic Regression 名字带 Regression，干的却是分类，新手第一次看都得愣一下。", "created_at": "2026-11-15T11:48:34.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/JMkernt/status/2121933373841281124", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121930754149974388", "author_id": "1653077955311177730", "text": "@UPing123zzz 工具学得快，原理没打底，遇到问题就只会换工具。分清分类、回归、聚类这些，判断该用什么方案会快很多，也省钱。补基础不用从头啃教材，拿手上一个真实业务问题，让 AI 讲它属于哪类问题、为什么，再自己讲一遍。会用工具的人越来越多，能说清为什么这么用的人反而少了。", "created_at": "2026-11-15T11:38:10.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Hatzhuang/status/2121930754149974388", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121928079358693553", "author_id": "2025144888204136448", "text": "@UPing123zzz 会搭应用和懂原理，中间差了几步？", "created_at": "2026-11-15T11:27:32.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/surlymochan/status/2121928079358693553", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2013894763225980930", "username": "baboonAI4S", "name": "Claude Qin", "verified": false}, {"id": "1878345967780646912", "username": "UPing123zzz", "name": "Ethan 恩宇", "verified": false}, {"id": "1666301154165399553", "username": "tiqinge", "name": "提秦| 🌊RIVER", "verified": false}, {"id": "1390955686142517249", "username": "KevinWeb3Nomad", "name": "Kevin Lin", "verified": false}, {"id": "1869077220540784640", "username": "abc123953468547", "name": "A1terE&o", "verified": false}, {"id": "2071871914533068800", "username": "swordBluesy", "name": "剑的 AI 实验室", "verified": false}, {"id": "2108438560416415744", "username": "TedCai233", "name": "Ted Cai", "verified": false}, {"id": "1773034957377798151", "username": "YY20070110", "name": "TL 桃李园圣（互）（rebat）", "verified": false}, {"id": "2112559128862494720", "username": "Yunian_Cheng", "name": "Yunian_Cheng", "verified": false}, {"id": "1825556649723240448", "username": "JMkernt", "name": "jimerrors", "verified": false}, {"id": "1653077955311177730", "username": "Hatzhuang", "name": "草帽哥", "verified": false}, {"id": "2025144888204136448", "username": "surlymochan", "name": "nick", "verified": false}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2122124185615118660", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzovrmmgbkbxy2r64d1dyy4a8wbjx", "oldest_id": "2121928079358693553", "result_count": 13}}